"Client issues `CONNECT`, `BIND`, or `UDP ASSOCIATE` with destination info."
msgstr "客户端携带目标信息发送 `CONNECT`、`BIND` 或 `UDP ASSOCIATE`。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
